    "The app reads available local network addresses so you can choose a listening address. Local Network permission is used to reach destinations on your local network. JustProxy does not request location access or read Wi-Fi network names.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app reads available local network addresses so you can choose a listening address. Local Network permission is used to reach destinations on your local network. JustProxy does not request location access or read Wi-Fi network names."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用读取本机可用网络地址，以提供监听地址选择。本地网络权限用于访问局域网目标。JustProxy 不申请定位权限，也不读取 Wi-Fi 名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
