    },
    "Upload and download totals, and the destination host, port, request method, and traffic for up to 50 recent connections, are kept only in device memory. They are not written to persistent files or uploaded to the developer. Statistics reset for a new proxy session; these records are released when the app process ends.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Upload and download totals, and the destination host, port, request method, and traffic for up to 50 recent connections, are kept only in device memory. They are not written to persistent files or uploaded to the developer. Statistics reset for a new proxy session; these records are released when the app process ends."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上传、下载字节数及最近 50 条连接的目标主机、端口、请求方式和流量仅保存在本机内存中，不写入持久化文件，也不上传给开发者。新代理会话会重新统计；应用进程结束后，这些内存记录随之释放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the proxy is running, JustProxy processes client requests on your iPhone and forwards them to their requested destinations. Destination services and networks may process these requests under their own privacy policies. HTTPS CONNECT traffic is relayed through tunnels; JustProxy does not install certificates to decrypt HTTPS.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When the proxy is running, JustProxy processes client requests on your iPhone and forwards them to their requested destinations. Destination services and networks may process these requests under their own privacy policies. HTTPS CONNECT traffic is relayed through tunnels; JustProxy does not install certificates to decrypt HTTPS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启代理后，JustProxy 在你的 iPhone 上处理客户端请求，并转发到请求指定的目标服务器。目标服务和所用网络可能按各自的隐私政策处理这些请求。HTTPS CONNECT 使用隧道转发，JustProxy 不安装用于解密 HTTPS 的证书。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can stop the proxy at any time using the main power button. Ending the app process clears its session records from memory. There is no account or personal profile stored on developer-operated servers to delete.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can stop the proxy at any time using the main power button. Ending the app process clears its session records from memory. There is no account or personal profile stored on developer-operated servers to delete."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可以随时点击主界面的大按钮关闭代理。结束应用进程可清除内存中的会话记录。应用没有开发者服务器上的账号或个人档案需要删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
